steps.instruction:
Choose one observed random-line ring and work only on that ring:
{ringPlan}
Open Enhancement → Soul Binding → Sync, select the unwanted line on the chosen ring, and add a Sync Stone or material the current window accepts. Inspect consumption, success chance and the skill pool before rolling for Overhead Slam +1. Set a Kina/material spending limit first. Stop when it lands or when that limit is reached; success is not guaranteed within your budget.
